    id: 193,
    title: "Amazon Echo Frames (3rd Gen) smart Alexa spectacles offer fashion and on-the-go smarts",
    slug: "amazon-echo-frames-3rd-gen-smart-alexa-spectacles-offer-fashion-and-on-the-go-sm",
    description: "Open-frame audio eyewear occupies a narrow but increasingly crowded lane — Bose Frames, Razer Anzu, and Meta Ray-Bans all compete here, and the third generation of Amazon's entry sits in the mid-tier of that field, priced at $194.99 before prescription lenses. Unlike Meta's Ray-Ban collaboration, which leans hard into camera hardware and social integration, the Echo Frames prioritize Alexa-native voice interaction and daily wearability. The five frame styles — Square, Round, Cat Eye, Rectangle, and Modern Rectangle — give this more fashion range than most competitors at the price, and IPX4 water resistance covers sweat and light rain without pretending this is a sports product.\n\nThe audio delivery relies on directional speakers embedded in the temples, angled toward the ears without any in-canal contact. This open-ear architecture means audio bleeds at moderate volume — a known and inherent trade-off of the form factor, not a defect. There's no active noise cancellation here by design; the point is ambient awareness. The microphone array is what actually does the heavy lifting: it handles far-field Alexa wake-word detection in a compact frame, which requires meaningful beam-forming given the hardware constraints. Bluetooth connectivity handles audio routing to a paired phone, and Alexa processes requests via the companion app. Prescription compatibility is built in — the lenses are standard and swappable through Amazon's partner opticians, which meaningfully expands the real addressable market beyond the fashion-tech curiosity crowd.\n\nSix hours of continuous media playback is the headline stamina figure, which lands roughly in line with Bose Frames but behind Meta Ray-Bans' claimed 4 hours of combined audio and AI use — different workloads, so direct comparison requires caution. Charge time and wattage aren't specified, but the proprietary magnetic charging cradle is the method. Bluetooth codec support isn't disclosed beyond standard connectivity, which is a notable gap for audiophiles — no confirmed aptX, LDAC, or AAC prioritization means the audio pipeline is probably optimized for voice clarity over hi-fi playback. Alexa integration covers the full skill ecosystem, timers, calls, smart home control, and music via Amazon Music or Spotify, but response latency is network-dependent and noticeably slower than a dedicated Echo speaker in the same Wi-Fi environment.\n\nThe right buyer here is someone already deep in the Alexa ecosystem who wears prescription glasses daily and wants ambient voice access without carrying earbuds. That's a specific profile, but it's a genuine one. Against Meta Ray-Bans, the Frames lose on camera hardware and social features but win on Alexa depth and frame style variety. Against Bose Frames, the price is competitive but audio quality likely trails. Buyers who want the best open-ear audio in eyewear form should look at Bose Frames Tempo or Alto first. At $194.99 before lenses, the Echo Frames make most sense as a productivity and smart home control layer worn on the face, not as a primary listening device.",
    price: 194.99,
    category: "Smart Home",
    categorySlug: "smart-home",
    image: "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-01.jpg",
    images: ["/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-01.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-02.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-03.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-04.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-05.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-06.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-07.jpg", "/images/mirrored/Echo-Frames-3rd-Gen-Smart-High-End-Alexa-Spectacles-08.jpg"],
